            "paragraph": "['Chinese electric vehicle (EV) maker BYD has reported annual revenue for 2024 that hasexceeded U.S. rival Tesla.', \"BBC News reports that the Shenzhen-based EV carmaker reported on March 25 that 2024 revenue rose by 29%, to 777 billion yuan ($107 billion), compared to the $97.7 billion reported by Elon Musk's Tesla.\", \"BYD sold around the same number of EVs as Tesla last year \u2013 1.76 million compared to 1.79 million, respectively. But when sales of the Chinese company's hybrid cars are taken into account it is much bigger, selling a record 4.3 million vehicles globally in 2024.\"]",
